WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.467
Open Compress images. Try a sample photo to practise.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:14.933
Enter 100 KB and choose JPG as the output format.

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:22.400
Select Compress photo. Check the preview and file size.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:29.867
Choose Download photo. Your result stays on your device.
